      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i'll keep the ttl thing in mind for next time. it's just annoying because some users are reporting they can't reach the site at all, while others are fine. it almost feels like the data is just... vanishing or hiding in certain spots. is it possible for the records to just get lost or corrupted during that process?",
